        </bogi_item>
        <bogi_item symbol="ㄷ" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <statement>DML(Data Manipulation Language)을 활용하여 생성 및 변환</statement>
          <commentary>제시문의 "DML(Data Manipulation Language)을 활용하여 생성 및 변환" 내용과 일치하므로 옳다.</commentary>
        </bogi_item>
        <bogi_item symbol="ㄹ" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <statement>DDL(Data Definition Language)을 활용하여 생성 및 변환</statement>
          <commentary>제시문의 "DDL(Data Definition Language)을 활용하여 생성 및 변환" 내용과 일치하므로 옳다.</commentary>
        </bogi_item>
      </bogi_analysis>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ㄱ, ㄴ ㄷ, ㄹ</choice_text>
          <commentary>연결이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>ㄱ, ㄹ ㄴ, ㄷ</choice_text>
          <commentary>스키마는 ㄱ, ㄹ, 인스턴스는 ㄴ, ㄷ이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ㄴ, ㄷ ㄱ, ㄹ</choice_text>
          <commentary>반대로 연결하였다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>ㄴ, ㄹ ㄱ, ㄷ</choice_text>
          <commentary>연결이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
